lvo 142E          | 21.4|   4| 121.0| 109| 4.11| 2.780| 18.60|  1|  1|    4|    2|\n\n</div>\n:::\n:::\n\n\n### Base R: `subset()`\n\n**Description**:\nProvides a more human-readable syntax for subsetting.\n\n**Syntax**:\n\n```r\nsubset(data, subset, select)\n```\n\n**Examples**:\n\n1. Subset rows where `mpg > 20` and select `mpg` and `cyl` columns:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nsubset(mtcars, mpg > 20, select = c(mpg, cyl))\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n<div class=\"kable-table\">\n\n|               |  mpg| cyl|\n|:--------------|----:|---:|\n|Mazda RX4      | 21.0|   6|\n|Mazda RX4 Wag  | 21.0|   6|\n|Datsun 710     | 22.8|   4|\n|Hornet 4 Drive | 21.4|   6|\n|Merc 240D      | 24.4|   4|\n|Merc 230       | 22.8|   4|\n|Fiat 128       | 32.4|   4|\n|Honda Civic    | 30.4|   4|\n|Toyota Corolla | 33.9|   4|\n|Toyota Corona  | 21.5|   4|\n|Fiat X1-9      | 27.3|   4|\n|Porsche 914-2  | 26.0|   4|\n|Lotus Europa   | 30.4|   4|\n|Volvo 142E     | 21.4|   4|\n\n</div>\n:::\n:::\n\n\n2. Subset using multiple conditions:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nsubset(mtcars, mpg > 20 & cyl == 6, select = c(mpg, cyl))\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n<div class=\"kable-table\">\n\n|               |  mpg| cyl|\n|:--------------|----:|---:|\n|Mazda RX4      | 21.0|   6|\n|Mazda RX4 Wag  | 21.0|   6|\n|Hornet 4 Drive | 21.4|   6|\n\n</div>\n:::\n:::\n\n\n**Nuances**:\n\n- Non-standard evaluation allows simpler syntax but can lead to ambiguities. Use column names explicitly when necessary.\n\n### Tidyverse: `dplyr::filter()`\n\n**Description**:\nFilters rows based on logical conditions.\n\n**Syntax**:\n\n```r\ndplyr::filter(data, condition)\n```\n\n**Examples**:\n\n1. Filter rows with `mpg > 20`:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nmtcars |>\n    dplyr::filter(mpg > 20)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n<div class=\"kable-table\">\n\n|               |  mpg| cyl|  disp|  hp| drat|    wt|  qsec| vs| am| gear| carb|\n|:--------------|----:|---:|-----:|---