.4|   4|  95.1| 113| 3.77| 1.513| 16.90|  1|  1|    5|    2|\n|Ford Pantera L      | 15.8|   8| 351.0| 264| 4.22| 3.170| 14.50|  0|  1|    5|    4|\n|Ferrari Dino        | 19.7|   6| 145.0| 175| 3.62| 2.770| 15.50|  0|  1|    5|    6|\n|Maserati Bora       | 15.0|   8| 301.0| 335| 3.54| 3.570| 14.60|  0|  1|    5|    8|\n|Volvo 142E          | 21.4|   4| 121.0| 109| 4.11| 2.780| 18.60|  1|  1|    4|    2|\n\n</div>\n:::\n:::\n\n\n### Tidyverse: `dplyr::select()`\n\n**Description**:\nSelects specific columns from a data frame.\n\n**Syntax**:\n\n```r\ndplyr::select(data, columns)\n```\n\n**Examples**:\n\n1. Select specific columns:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nmtcars |>\n    dplyr::select(mpg, cyl)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n<div class=\"kable-table\">\n\n|                    |  mpg| cyl|\n|:-------------------|----:|---:|\n|Mazda RX4           | 21.0|   6|\n|Mazda RX4 Wag       | 21.0|   6|\n|Datsun 710          | 22.8|   4|\n|Hornet 4 Drive      | 21.4|   6|\n|Hornet Sportabout   | 18.7|   8|\n|Valiant             | 18.1|   6|\n|Duster 360          | 14.3|   8|\n|Merc 240D           | 24.4|   4|\n|Merc 230            | 22.8|   4|\n|Merc 280            | 19.2|   6|\n|Merc 280C           | 17.8|   6|\n|Merc 450SE          | 16.4|   8|\n|Merc 450SL          | 17.3|   8|\n|Merc 450SLC         | 15.2|   8|\n|Cadillac Fleetwood  | 10.4|   8|\n|Lincoln Continental | 10.4|   8|\n|Chrysler Imperial   | 14.7|   8|\n|Fiat 128            | 32.4|   4|\n|Honda Civic         | 30.4|   4|\n|Toyota Corolla      | 33.9|   4|\n|Toyota Corona       | 21.5|   4|\n|Dodge Challenger    | 15.5|   8|\n|AMC Javelin         | 15.2|   8|\n|Camaro Z28          | 13.3|   8|\n|Pontiac Firebird    | 19.2|   8|\n|Fiat X1-9           | 27.3|   4|\n|Porsche 914-2       | 26.0|   4|\n|Lotus Europa        | 30.4|   4|\n|Ford Pantera L      | 15.8|   8|\n|Ferrari Dino        | 19.7|   6|\n|Maserati Bora       | 15.0|   8|\n|Volvo 142E          | 21.4|   4|\n\n</div>\n:::\n:::\n\n\n2. Use helpers for dynamic selection:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nmtcars |>\n    dplyr::select(starts_with(\"d\"))\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n<div class=\"kable-table\">\n\n|                    |  disp| drat|\n|:-------------------|-----:|----:|\n|Mazda RX4           | 160.0| 3.90|\n|Mazda RX4 Wag       | 160.0| 3.90|\n|Datsun 710          | 108.0| 3.85|\n|Hornet 4 Drive      | 258.0| 3.08|\n|Hornet Sportabout   | 360.0| 3.15|\n|Valiant             | 225.0| 2.76|\n|Duster 360          | 360.0| 3.21|\n|Merc 240D           | 146.7| 3.69|\n|Merc 230            | 140.8| 3.92|\n|Merc 280            | 167.6| 3.92|\n|Merc 280C           | 167.6| 3.92|\n|Merc 450SE          | 275.8| 3.07|\n|Merc 450SL          | 275.8| 3.07|\n|Merc 450SLC         | 275.8| 3.07|\n|Cadillac Fleetwood  | 472.0| 2.93|\n|Lincoln Continental | 460.0| 3.00|\n|Chrysler Imperial   | 440.0| 3.23|\n|Fiat 128            |  78.7| 4.08|\n|Honda Civic         |  75.7| 4.93|\n|Toyota Corolla      |  71.1| 4.22|\n|Toyota Corona       | 120.1| 3.70|\n|Dodge Challenger    | 318.0| 2.76|\n|AMC Javelin         | 304.0| 3.15|\n|Camaro Z28          | 350.0| 3.73|\n|Pontiac Firebird    | 400.0| 3.08|\n|Fiat X1-9           |  79.0| 4.08|\n|Porsche 914-2       | 120.3| 4.43|\n|Lotus Europa        |  95.1| 3.77|\n|Ford Pantera L      | 351.0| 4.22|\n|Ferrari Dino        | 145.0| 3.62|\n|Maserati Bora       | 301.0| 3.54|\n|Volvo 142E          | 121.0| 4.11|\n\n</div>\n:::\n:::\n\n\n**Nuances**:\n\n- Combine helpers for advanced selection:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nmtcars |>\n    dplyr::select(starts_with(\"d\"), ends_with(\"t\"))\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n<div class=\"kable-table\">\n\n|                    |  disp| drat|    wt|\n|:-------------------|-----:|----:|-----:|\n|Mazda RX4           | 160.0| 3.90| 2.620|\n|Mazda RX4 Wag       | 160.0| 3.90| 2.875|\n|Datsun 710          | 108.0| 3.85| 2.320|\n|Hornet 4 Drive      | 258.0| 3.08| 3.215|\n|Hornet Sportabout   | 360.0| 3.15| 3.440|\n|Valiant             | 225.0| 2.76| 3.460|\n|Duster 360          | 360.0| 3.21| 3.570|\n|Merc 240D           | 146.7| 3.69| 3.190|\n|Merc 230            | 140.8| 3.92| 3.150|\n|Merc 280            | 167.6| 3.92| 3.440|\n|Merc 280C           | 167.6| 3.92| 3.440|\n|Merc 450SE          | 275.8| 3.07| 4.070|\n|Merc 450SL          | 275.8| 3.07| 3.730|\n|Merc 450SLC         | 275.8| 3.07| 3.780|\n|Cadillac Fleetwood  | 472.0| 2.93| 5.250|\n|Lincoln Continental | 460.0| 3.00| 5.424|\n|Chrysler Imperial   | 440.0| 3.23| 5.345|\n|Fiat 128            |  78.7| 4.08| 2.200|\n|Honda Civic         |  75.7| 4.93| 1.615|\n|Toyota Corolla      |  71.1| 4.22| 1.835|\n|Toyota Corona       | 120.1| 3.70| 2.465|\n|Dodge Challenger    | 318.0| 2.76| 3.520|\n|AMC Javelin         | 304.0| 3.15| 3.435|\n|Camaro Z28          | 350.0| 3.73| 3.840|\n|Pontiac Firebird    | 400.0| 3.08| 3.845|\n|Fiat X1-9           |  79.0| 4.08| 1.935|\n|Porsche 914-2       | 120.3| 4.43| 2.140|\n|Lotus Europa        |  95.1| 3.77| 1.513|\n|Ford Pantera L      | 351.0| 4.22| 3.170|\n|Ferrari Dino        | 145.0| 3.62| 2.770|\n|Maserati Bora       | 301.0| 3.54| 3.570|\n|Volvo 142E          | 121.0| 4.11| 2.780|\n\n</div>\n:::\n:::\n\n\n### Tidyverse: `dplyr::slice()`\n\n**Description**:\nSelects rows by position.\n\n**Syntax**:\n\n```r\ndplyr::slice(data, row_numbers)\n```\n\n**Examples**:\n\n1. Select the first five rows:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nmtcars |>\n    dplyr::slice(1:5)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n<div class=\"kable-table\">\n\n|                  |  mpg| cyl| disp|  hp| drat|    wt|  qsec| vs| am| gear| carb|\n|:-----------------|----:|---:|----:|---:|----:|-----:|-----:|--:|--:|----:|----:|\n|Mazda RX4         | 21.0|   6|  160| 110| 3.90| 2.620| 16.46|  0|  1|    4|    4|\n|Mazda RX4 Wag     | 21.0|   6|  160| 110| 3.90| 2.875| 17.02|  0|  1|    4|    4|\n|Datsun 710        | 22.8|   4|  108|  93| 3.85| 2.320| 18.61|  1|  1|    4|    1|\n|Hornet 4 Drive    | 21.4|   6|  258| 110| 3.08| 3.215| 19.44|  1|  0|    3|    1|\n|Hornet Sportabout | 18.7|   8|  360| 175| 3.15| 3.440| 17.02|  0|  0|    3|    2|\n\n</div>\n:::\n:::\n\n\n2. Random sampling:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nmtcars |>\n    dplyr::slice_sample(n = 5)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n<div class=\"kable-table\">\n\n|               |  mpg| cyl|  disp|  hp| drat|    wt|  qsec| vs| am| gear| carb|\n|:--------------|----:|---:|-----:|---:|----:|-----:|-----:|--:|--:|----:|----:|\n|Hornet 4 Drive | 21.4|   6| 258.0| 110| 3.08| 3.215| 19.44|  1|  0|    3|    1|\n|Fiat 128       | 32.4|   4|  78.7|  66| 4.08| 2.200| 19.47|  1|  1|    4|    1|\n|Toyota Corona  | 21.5|   4| 120.1|  97| 3.70| 2.465| 20.01|  1|  0|    3|    1|\n|Mazda RX4      | 21.0|   6| 160.0| 110| 3.90| 2.620| 16.46|  0|  1|    4|    4|\n|Merc 450SE     | 16.4|   8| 275.8| 180| 3.07| 4.070| 17.40|  0|  0|    3|    3|\n\n</div>\n:::\n:::\n\n\n3. Select rows by percentages:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nmtcars |>\n    dplyr::slice_sample(prop = .1)  # 10% of rows\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n<div class=\"kable-table\">\n\n|               |  mpg| cyl|  disp|  hp| drat|   wt| qsec| vs| am| gear| carb|\n|:--------------|----:|---:|-----:|---:|----:|----:|----:|--:|--:|----:|----:|\n|Porsche 914-2  | 26.0|   4| 120.3|  91| 4.43| 2.14| 16.7|  0|  1|    5|    2|\n|Ferrari Dino   | 19.7|   6| 145.0| 175| 3.62| 2.77| 15.5|  0|  1|    5|    6|\n|Ford Pantera L | 15.8|   8| 351.0| 264| 4.22| 3.17| 14.5|  0|  1|    5|    4|\n\n</div>\n:::\n:::\n\n\n### Tidyverse: `dplyr::pull()`\n\n**Description**:\nExtracts a single column as a vector.\n\n**Syntax**:\n\n```r\ndplyr::pull(data, column)\n```\n\n**Examples**:\n\n1. Pull the `mpg` column:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nmtcars |>\n    dplyr::pull(mpg)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n [1] 21.0 21.0 22.8 21.4 18.7 18.1 14.3 24.4 22.8 19.2 17.8 16.4 17.3 15.2 10.4\n[16] 10.4 14.7 32.4 30.4 33.9 21.5 15.5 15.2 13.3 19.2 27.3 26.0 30.4 15.8 19.7\n[31] 15.0 21.4\n```\n\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n2. Combine with filtering:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nmtcars |>\n    dplyr::filter(cyl == 6) |>\n    dplyr::pull(mpg)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n[1] 21.0 21.0 21.4 18.1 19.2 17.8 19.7\n```\n\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n**Nuances**:\n\n- Useful for extracting data for external functions:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nmean(mtcars |> dplyr::pull(mpg))\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}\n\n```\n[1] 20.09062\n```\n\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## In-Depth Examples\n\n### Example 1: Dynamic Filtering with External Variables\n\nObjective: Filter rows based on user-defined thresholds for `mpg` and `hp`.\n\nSteps:\n\n1. Define thresholds:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nmpg_threshold <- 20\nhp_threshold <- 100\n```\n:::\n\n\n2. Base R:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nmtcars[mtcars$mpg > mpg_threshold & mtcars$hp > hp_threshold, ]\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n<div class=\"kable-table\">\n\n|               |  mpg| cyl|  disp|  hp| drat|    wt|  qsec| vs| am| gear| carb|\n|:--------------|----:|---:|-----:|---:|----:|-----:|-----:|--:|--:|----:|----:|\n|Mazda RX4      | 21.0|   6| 160.0| 110| 3.90| 2.620| 16.46|  0|  1|    4|    4|\n|Mazda RX4 Wag  | 21.0|   6| 160.0| 110| 3.90| 2.875| 17.02|  0|  1|    4|    4|\n|Hornet 4 Drive | 21.4|   6| 258.0| 110| 3.08| 3.215| 19.44|  1|  0|    3|    1|\n|Lotus Europa   | 30.4|   4|  95.1| 113| 3.77| 1.513| 16.90|  1|  1|    5|    2|\n|Volvo 142E     | 21.4|   4| 121.0| 109| 4.11| 2.780| 18.60|  1|  1|    4|    2|\n\n</div>\n:::\n:::\n\n\n3. Tidyverse:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nmtcars |>\n    dplyr::filter(mpg > mpg_threshold & hp > hp_threshold)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n<div class=\"kable-table\">\n\n|               |  mpg| cyl|  disp|  hp| drat|    wt|  qsec| vs| am| gear| carb|\n|:--------------|----:|---:|-----:|---:|----:|-----:|-----:|--:|--:|----:|----:|\n|Mazda RX4      | 21.0|   6| 160.0| 110| 3.90| 2.620| 16.46|  0|  1|    4|    4|\n|Mazda RX4 Wag  | 21.0|   6| 160.0| 110| 3.90| 2.875| 17.02|  0|  1|    4|    4|\n|Hornet 4 Drive | 21.4|   6| 258.0| 110| 3.08| 3.215| 19.44|  1|  0|    3|    1|\n|Lotus Europa   | 30.4|   4|  95.1| 113| 3.77| 1.513| 16.90|  1|  1|    5|    2|\n|Volvo 142E     | 21.4|   4| 121.0| 109| 4.11| 2.780| 18.60|  1|  1|    4|    2|\n\n</div>\n:::\n:::\n\n\n### Example 2: Visualizing Subsets\n\nObjective: Visualize cars with `mpg > 20`.\n\nSteps:\n\n1. Subset data:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nfiltered_data <- mtcars |>\n    dplyr::filter(mpg > 20)\n```\n:::\n\n\n2. Plot:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nlibrary(ggplot2)\nggplot(filtered_data, aes(x = wt, y = mpg)) +\n    geom_point()\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![](r-subsetting-basics_files/figure-html/unnamed-chunk-29-1.png){width=672}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Advanced Features\n\nCustomization:\n\n- Create reusable functions for subsetting:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nfilter_cars <- function(data, mpg_threshold, cyl_threshold) {\n    data |>\n        dplyr::filter(mpg > mpg_threshold, cyl == cyl_threshold)\n}\n\nfilter_cars(mtcars, 20, 6)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n<div class=\"kable-table\">\n\n|               |  mpg| cyl| disp|  hp| drat|    wt|  qsec| vs| am| gear| carb|\n|:--------------|----:|---:|----:|---:|----:|-----:|-----:|--:|--:|----:|----:|\n|Mazda RX4      | 21.0|   6|  160| 110| 3.90| 2.620| 16.46|  0|  1|    4|    4|\n|Mazda RX4 Wag  | 21.0|   6|  160| 110| 3.90| 2.875| 17.02|  0|  1|    4|    4|\n|Hornet 4 Drive | 21.4|   6|  258| 110| 3.08| 3.215| 19.44|  1|  0|    3|    1|\n\n</div>\n:::\n:::\n\n\nIntegration:\n\n- Combine `tidyr` for reshaping with subsetting:\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n```{.r .cell-code}\nlibrary(tidyr)\nmtcars |>\n    pivot_longer(cols = everything()) |>\n    dplyr::filter(value > 20)\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n<div class=\"kable-table\">\n\n|name |  value|\n|:----|------:|